{"n":21,"title":"Is it always like this here?","blurb":"Говорить о погоде","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"Is it always like this here?","sub":"","html":"<p>Погода в реальном времени — что происходит за окном прямо сейчас.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Говорить о погоде</li><li>Называть времена года</li><li>Говорить, что происходит сейчас</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Какая сегодня погода?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"sunny"},{"label":"cloudy"},{"label":"rainy"},{"label":"snowy"},{"label":"cold"},{"label":"hot"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"sunny","pos":"","ru":"солнечно","kk":"күн ашық","def":"It's sunny today.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/acd7cf1c5bad.mp3"},{"en":"cloudy","pos":"","ru":"облачно","kk":"бұлтты","def":"It's a little cloudy.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/38a014eca93d.mp3"},{"en":"rainy","pos":"","ru":"дождливо","kk":"жаңбырлы","def":"It's rainy here.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/a52f927622a7.mp3"},{"en":"stormy","pos":"","ru":"штормит","kk":"дауылды","def":"It's stormy at the coast.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/6a7e523c0e8c.mp3"},{"en":"snowy","pos":"","ru":"снежно","kk":"қарлы","def":"In winter it's often snowy.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/796a0e8cf35e.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите погоду.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/bc9786226647.mp3","prompt":"","options":["It's hot.","It's cold.","It's warm."],"answer":"It's cold.","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите погоду.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/dd8c225a15e5.mp3","prompt":"","options":["It's warm.","It's hot.","It's windy."],"answer":"It's warm.","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"spring","pos":"","ru":"весна","kk":"көктем","def":"In spring it's warm.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/20ee40d86d21.mp3"},{"en":"summer","pos":"","ru":"лето","kk":"жаз","def":"Summer is my favourite season.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/3ed72e46a481.mp3"},{"en":"autumn","pos":"","ru":"осень","kk":"күз","def":"In autumn it's often rainy.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/9926a46f840c.mp3"},{"en":"winter","pos":"","ru":"зима","kk":"қыс","def":"In winter it's very cold.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/664305967451.mp3"},{"en":"temperature","pos":"","ru":"температура","kk":"температура","def":"What's the temperature today?","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Одно — обычно, другое — прямо сейчас.","items":[{"text":"In winter it snows here.","src":null},{"text":"Look! It's raining now.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Present Continuous — сейчас","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Сейчас</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>It</td><td>is + -ing</td><td>It's raining.</td></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>am + -ing</td><td>I'm working at home today.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>are + -ing</td><td>You're sitting outside.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>are + -ing</td><td>They're waiting for the bus.</td></tr></table><p>Две части: <b>am / is / are</b> + глагол + <b>-ing</b>.</p><p>Это значит <b>прямо сейчас</b>, в этот момент.</p><p>Первую часть нельзя опускать: «It raining» — неверно.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Обычно или сейчас?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Обычно</th><th>Прямо сейчас</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>It rains a lot in autumn.</td><td>It's raining now.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>I work in an office.</td><td>I'm working at home today.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>She drinks tea.</td><td>She's drinking coffee now.</td></tr></table><p>Present Simple (урок 13) — про привычки и обычное.</p><p>Present Continuous — про этот момент: <b>now</b>, <b>right now</b>, <b>today</b>.</p><p>Спросить о погоде: <b>What's the weather like?</b></p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">«What's it like?» спрашивает описание, не сравнение.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["What's the weather like?","It's sunny and warm.","Look! It's raining.","The sun is shining.","I'm working at home today.","In winter it's often snowy."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"Look! It ___ raining.","options":["are","is","be"],"keep":false,"answer":"is","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ working at home today.","options":["am","is","are"],"keep":false,"answer":"am","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"They ___ waiting for the bus.","options":["is","am","are"],"keep":false,"answer":"are","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The sun is","after":".","answers":["shining"],"bank":["shining","shines","shine"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"It's","after":"outside. Look!","answers":["snowing"],"bank":["snow","snowing","snows"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She's","after":"dinner right now.","answers":["cooking"],"bank":["cooking","cook","cooks"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Обычно или прямо сейчас?","sub":"","columns":["Обычно","Прямо сейчас"],"items":[{"text":"She drinks tea.","col":0},{"text":"In autumn it rains a lot here.","col":0},{"text":"She's drinking coffee.","col":1},{"text":"I'm working at home.","col":1},{"text":"I work in an office.","col":0},{"text":"It's raining.","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["weather","What","the","like?","is"],"answer":"What is the weather like?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","now.","right","raining","It"],"answer":"It is raining right now.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["In","winter","cold.","it","very","is"],"answer":"In winter it is very cold.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Look!","It","raining."],"bad":2,"answer":"Look! It's raining.","why":"Перед формой на -ing нужен is."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","am","work","at","home","today."],"bad":2,"answer":"I am working at home today.","why":"После am глагол получает -ing."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["It's","rain","today."],"bad":1,"answer":"It's raining today.","why":"Добавьте -ing: rain → raining."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/6d634e8b8425.mp3","prompt":"— What's the weather like with you?","options":["It's cloudy but warm.","It's very cold.","It's snowy."],"answer":"It's cloudy but warm.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/6d634e8b8425.mp3","before":"It's","after":"here.","answers":["rainy"],"bank":["rainy","sunny","stormy"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/b91cb447246a.mp3","prompt":"Какая погода зимой в Нью-Йорке?","options":["warm and rainy","very cold and often snowy","hot and sunny"],"answer":"very cold and often snowy","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Что происходит прямо сейчас?","src":null,"options":["It's raining.","It's snowing.","The sun is shining."],"answer":"It's raining.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"It's","after":"right now.","answers":["raining"],"bank":["raining","rainy","rains"],"src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/527d1777ccf4.mp3","prompt":"О каком городе речь?","options":["Auckland","Astana","New York"],"answer":"Auckland","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/527d1777ccf4.mp3","prompt":"Какая там погода?","options":["always cold","never sunny","warm and often rainy"],"answer":"warm and often rainy","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Камилу.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kamila</p><p>Hi! I'm Kamila. I live in Astana.</p><p>In winter it's very cold and snowy here.</p><p>Right now I'm at home and it's raining.</p><p>In summer it's hot and sunny. That's my favourite season.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"It's raining now.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kamila</p><p>Hi! I'm Kamila. I live in Astana.</p><p>In winter it's very cold and snowy here.</p><p>Right now I'm at home and it's raining.</p><p>In summer it's hot and sunny. That's my favourite season.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Winter is her favourite season.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kamila</p><p>Hi! I'm Kamila. I live in Astana.</p><p>In winter it's very cold and snowy here.</p><p>Right now I'm at home and it's raining.</p><p>In summer it's hot and sunny. That's my favourite season.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"In winter it's very cold and","after":".","answers":["snowy"],"bank":["sunny","snowy","warm"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kamila</p><p>Hi! I'm Kamila. I live in Astana.</p><p>In winter it's very cold and snowy here.</p><p>Right now I'm at home and it's raining.</p><p>In summer it's hot and sunny. That's my favourite season.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о погоде.","sub":"Сегодня и в любимое время года.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>Today it's ___ .</li><li>Right now I'm ___ .</li><li>In ___ it's ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">It's</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">sunny</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">rainy</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">snowy</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">cold</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">hot</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">working</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">sitting</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">summer</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">winter</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>В предложении про «сейчас» есть <b>am / is</b> + <b>-ing</b>.</li><li>Слово о погоде в конце: It's <b>sunny</b>.</li><li>Времена года — с <b>in</b>: <b>in</b> winter.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["What's the weather like?","It's sunny and warm.","Look! It's raining.","In winter it's very cold.","What's the temperature today?"]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 21 пройден","sub":"Урок 21 из 24 · Юнит 6","items":["Я могу говорить о погоде.","Я могу назвать времена года.","Я могу сказать, что происходит сейчас."]}]}
